Source: microvm-mcp
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Per Buer <per.buer@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3 (>= 3.11), ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/perbu/microvm-mcp

Package: microvm-mcp
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 microvm-mcp-python (>= 3.13.15+pbs20260901-1), microvm-mcp-python (<< 3.14),
 microvm-mcp-firecracker-1.17 (= 1.17.0-1),
 iproute2, nftables, iptables, ca-certificates, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Description: private Linux development microVMs over MCP and HTTP
 Workspace-authorized Firecracker service with a private, locked Python
 dependency set. Requires KVM, cgroup v2, root, and reflink-capable storage.
 The service remains stopped until explicitly configured and started.
 Guest kernel and rootfs images are provisioned separately.

Package: microvm-mcp-python
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ca-certificates, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Description: private CPython runtime for microvm-mcp
 Pinned python-build-standalone runtime used only by microvm-mcp.
 This package does not replace the system Python interpreter.

Package: microvm-mcp-firecracker-1.17
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Description: pinned Firecracker and jailer for microvm-mcp
 Matching Firecracker and jailer 1.17.0 binaries, kept byte-for-byte intact
 for checkpoint compatibility. Includes upstream third-party notices.
